From 1e0934bca756449b4f46e4ae7f6bef405e95295b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wangyunhua <wangyunhua3@contributor>


Date: Thu, 2 Apr 2026 01:29:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] BUGFIX:Fix drop table failure when recycle bin is
 enabled.

Issue:
------
Recycle bin only checked table name length before, but forgot to check foreign
key names. If a foreign key name is too long after rename, RENAME TABLE fails,
which leads to DROP TABLE failure.

Solution:
--------
Foreign keys are dropped after rename in recycle flow, so renaming
them is unnecessary and may fail due to name length limits.Skip FK
rename to avoid DROP TABLE failure.
